  "bio": "Jelly Tat, based in Calgary, Canada, is quickly establishing a reputation for their impeccable fineline tattoo work. As a first-year tattooer at 13 Cats Tattoo Studio, Jelly combines a fresh perspective with keen attention to detail, ensuring each piece is executed with precision and artistry. Their commitment to cleanliness is evident throughout their process, providing clients with both stunning designs and peace of mind.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Calgary, Alberta, Canada\n\n✿ tattooer & visual artist 🎂🛸🌷\n✿ BOOKS OPEN 🪩 link in bio to book 🌟\n✿ flat rate flash & hourly custom pieces 🖼️\n✿ calgary | yyc @13catstattoostudio 💖\n\n✿ tattooer & visual artist 🎂🛸🌷\n✿ BOOKS OPEN 🪩 link in bio to book 🌟\n✿ flat rate flash & hourly custom pieces 🖼️\n✿ calgary | yyc @13catstattoostudio 💖",
